{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw machine madness meets multiplayer mayhem!</strong><br>In <i>Grab Your Friends</i>, you're the claw \u2013 and your friends are the prizes. While you try to grab them from above in VR, they\u2019re scrambling around inside the machine, hiding, confusing you, and using sneaky tricks to stay out of reach. Can you catch them all before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/01610cc8a30fa97984c53f1b9cc7b686.avif?t=1772131067\" width=1380 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR vs Mobile: Cross-Platform Chaos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 player in VR</strong> controls the claw and hunts down the others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4 friends on mobile</strong> run around inside the claw machine \u2013 using real selfie avatars and special hats with unique powers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/cafcff59fc8bdddf7adc1462116eb155.avif?t=1772131067\" width=1536 height=666 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hide, Trick, Distract \u2013 The Hats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hat gives you a different ability:<br>\ud83e\udd32\ud83c\udffc <strong>Illusion Hat</strong> \u2013 Create a second version of yourself and switch places to confuse the claw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/eec55323858cd8e7ab42c2345b3995e5.poster.avif?t=1772131067\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/eec55323858cd8e7ab42c2345b3995e5.webm?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/eec55323858cd8e7ab42c2345b3995e5.mp4?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Bush Hat</strong> \u2013 Gather twigs and spawn bushes to hide your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/4cff7ddd4ee423680043923441c27ce4.poster.avif?t=1772131067\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/4cff7ddd4ee423680043923441c27ce4.webm?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/4cff7ddd4ee423680043923441c27ce4.mp4?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd91 <strong>Ink Hat</strong> \u2013 Splash ink on the glass and block the claw player\u2019s view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/582284be29e7d0c024c88b9b571ba2d4.poster.avif?t=1772131067\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/582284be29e7d0c024c88b9b571ba2d4.webm?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/582284be29e7d0c024c88b9b571ba2d4.mp4?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Ice Hat</strong> \u2013 Freeze the claw at the last second to stop a grab in its tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/a5d8e330ca84818240762cbb98d2d125.poster.avif?t=1772131067\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/a5d8e330ca84818240762cbb98d2d125.webm?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/a5d8e330ca84818240762cbb98d2d125.mp4?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast Rounds, Big Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for parties, family nights, or spontaneous fun with friends. Rounds are short, tension runs high \u2013 who plays it smarter? The friends helping and tricking each other, or the claw trying to stay in control? Every match is a fast-paced duel between chaos and control \u2013 and no one stays calm for long.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481490?t=1772131067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/f05eeba65605f48ab9a6ff4987d3dcc943bece93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772131067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/ab3bd5e8f46d1a691a060e0238fabf5edf23ba4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772131067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/ab3bd5e8f46d1a691a060e0238fabf5edf23ba4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772131067","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw machine madness meets multiplayer mayhem!</strong><br>In <i>Grab Your Friends</i>, you're the claw \u2013 and your friends are the prizes. While you try to grab them from above in VR, they\u2019re scrambling around inside the machine, hiding, confusing you, and using sneaky tricks to stay out of reach. Can you catch them all before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/01610cc8a30fa97984c53f1b9cc7b686.avif?t=1772131067\" width=1380 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR vs Mobile: Cross-Platform Chaos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 player in VR</strong> controls the claw and hunts down the others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4 friends on mobile</strong> run around inside the claw machine \u2013 using real selfie avatars and special hats with unique powers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/cafcff59fc8bdddf7adc1462116eb155.avif?t=1772131067\" width=1536 height=666 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hide, Trick, Distract \u2013 The Hats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hat gives you a different ability:<br>\ud83e\udd32\ud83c\udffc <strong>Illusion Hat</strong> \u2013 Create a second version of yourself and switch places to confuse the claw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/eec55323858cd8e7ab42c2345b3995e5.poster.avif?t=1772131067\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481490/extras/eec55323858cd8e7ab42c2345b3995e5.webm?t=1772131067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams